  "body": "## What's Changed\r\n* fix: wait for profiler readiness in simple_malloc attach test by @r1viollet in https://github.com/DataDog/ddprof/pull/569\r\n* Upgrade libdatadog to v46.0.0 by @r1viollet in https://github.com/DataDog/ddprof/pull/563\r\n* Fix lazy TLS deadlock with non-cancelling stack discovery by @r1viollet in https://github.com/DataDog/ddprof/pull/568\r\n* Bump ddprof version to 0.27.1 by @r1viollet in https://github.com/DataDog/ddprof/pull/572\r\n* Fix main-stack bounds in musl builds by @r1viollet in https://github.com/DataDog/ddprof/pull/570\r\n* Fix source filename reuse in the function cache by @r1viollet in https://github.com/DataDog/ddprof/pull/565\r\n* Add DT_HASH support to ELF symbol lookup by @nsavoire in https://github.com/DataDog/ddprof/pull/574\r\n* [PROF-16649] Avoid repeated failed perf ring-buffer mirroring by @r1viollet in https://github.com/DataDog/ddprof/pull/576\r\n\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/DataDog/ddprof/compare/v0.27.0...v0.27.1",
